  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-ger-gir",
  "titulo": "Conjugate -ger and -gir verbs (g > j) in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Proteger → proteja: the g becomes j to keep the soft sound.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Verbs ending in -ger and -gir change g to j in every form of the present subjunctive: proteja, dirija, escojamos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs ending in **-ger** and **-gir** change the **g** to **j** in every form of the present subjunctive. This keeps the sound of the infinitive, because **g** before **a** would sound hard."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "proteger",
            "dirigir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "proteja",
              "dirija"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "protejas",
              "dirijas"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "proteja",
              "dirija"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "protejamos",
              "dirijamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "protejan",
              "dirijan"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Other verbs like this: **recoger**, **escoger**, **acoger**, **exigir**, **sumergir**, **fingir**, and **coger**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Coger** is a vulgar word in Mexico. Use **agarrar** or **tomar** instead: **toma el camión**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **g** goes soft only with **e** and **i**. To stay soft before **a**, it puts on a **j**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
